  "sn35.63:1.1": "",
  "sn35.63:1.2": "Migajāla’s verses are at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/thag6.8/en/sujato'>Thag 6.8</a>. ",
  "sn35.63:1.3": "",
  "sn35.63:1.4": "“One who lives alone” (<i lang='pi' translate='no'>ekavihārī</i>) is also mentioned at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn21.10/en/sujato#1.5'>SN 21.10:1.5</a> and <a href='https://suttacentral.net/thag10.2/en/sujato'>Thag 10.2</a>. ",
  "sn35.63:1.5": "“Partner” is <i lang='pi' translate='no'>dutiya</i> (“second”), a companion or spouse. ",
  "sn35.63:2.1": "",
  "sn35.63:2.2": "",
  "sn35.63:2.3": "",
  "sn35.63:2.4": "",
  "sn35.63:2.5": "",
  "sn35.63:2.6": "",
  "sn35.63:2.7": "",
  "sn35.63:2.8": "MS omits <i lang='pi' translate='no'>mano</i> here in error. It is included in the following round in this Sutta, and in both rounds of the next Sutta. <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Mano</i> is found in the PTS and BJT editions, which I follow here. ",
